  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Us mutes and deaf people love the chatbox. But, not everyone knows it exists cuz' not everyone keeps up with the patches. And, the chatbox default set to friends only makes it really difficult for mutes to talk in public worlds to random people. They just can't cuz' the people they talk to can't see the chatbox since they probably don't know it can be set to everyone or that it even exists. My point is, the default being set to friends only was a bad idea. It should be defaulted to everyone and an option to set it to friends only cuz' right now, it's not completely serving its intended purpose.",
